title: Kubernetes: Cluster Info
agents: kubernetes
catalog: containerization/kubernetes
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check displays general information about the Kubernetes cluster such
 as the configured name. The service is always {OK}. This check requires that
 Kubernetes monitoring is configured and that Checkmk can receive data from the
 in-cluster agent.

 Checkmk supports Kubernetes version 1.26, 1.27, 1.28, 1.29, 1.30 and 1.31.

discovery:
 One service is created for the cluster.
